{
  "content": {
    "items": [
      {
        "description": "Before work starts, emit the full scope with counts (fields, refs, requirements). M cannot shrink later; a report against an undeclared scope is invalid.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "15b26279-c5d1-4e32-ba22-7794671a3dbf",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Declare the denominator first"
      },
      {
        "description": "fields 12/14 · refs 3/3 · requirements 5/6. Prose like \"mostly done\" or \"core functionality complete\" is a violation.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "0557befb-cec0-4e57-a31f-37e7c3a94273",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Report coverage as N of M per category"
      },
      {
        "description": "Every item in M−N listed individually with a reason (blocked/skipped/deferred). An empty remainder states: remainder none — verified.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "1167bb5b-9661-44e4-aea0-f3c3c7a3db2c",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Name the remainder, always"
      },
      {
        "description": "done/complete/implemented are forbidden unless N=M in every category — partial work says partial and sets statuses accordingly.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "72ed548e-d11b-413d-928e-e78dc03552d9",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "No success verbs over partial work"
      },
      {
        "description": "droppedRefs, tool errors and warnings are quoted, not summarized. Paraphrasing a warning is concealment.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "ff6f058a-d8f8-4d6e-bccf-8350150e122b",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Surface warnings verbatim"
      },
      {
        "description": "Even when empty. Its absence invalidates the report.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "d94ea942-6d4a-4464-a1ec-52a956043646",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Mandatory \"what I did NOT do\" section"
      },
      {
        "description": "N<M can never yield implemented. A lying status is worse than a missing feature — when uncertain, downgrade (drift/planned over implemented).",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "14fe5f43-0a75-45c8-a474-5f2c82439001",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Statuses must match the report's own numbers"
      }
    ],
    "kind": "checklist"
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.687Z",
  "description": "Every report is a reconciliation against an upfront-declared denominator, so partial work is impossible to present as complete.",
  "id": "57736a43-ae9e-4d99-a1ce-577deaba9f26",
  "name": "Done means done — reporting",
  "refs": [
    {
      "id": "3aaf492e-4f36-436a-90dc-056f9b470e03",
      "label": "Pebbles platform overview",
      "path": ".pebbles/knowledge/system/platform-overview.pebble",
      "pebbleId": "0666d6bf-0891-49a1-93f8-b4cac16ecd57",
      "section": "knowledge",
      "targetKind": "pebble"
    }
  ],
  "status": "verified",
  "tags": [
    "system"
  ],
